4-dcd61948454c\",[\"Eric Lee\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV3zyimtCM0qYE8ciZpNjYkVjF4L8ajkZ95IbRmvLSecEvwFatT\"]]],5,null,\"Easy transfer. I like it!\",[1765356730,985000000],0,null,null,[\"113003253021979249092\",\"Eric Lee\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV3zyimtCM0qYE8ciZpNjYkVjF4L8ajkZ95IbRmvLSecEvwFatT\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"7.3.8\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"5ebe55d3-e8df-49d4-a4ab-01f97c6ce667\",[\"Y. H. Au\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK5GsKQ8oel6-BmLb9_HiXjsSvVDL0jIpQo0OU6XZhPr81QGg\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"垃圾。 1. 注册。攪完一大輪原來有工作時間只限日間。點解一早唔講？ 2. 注完册登入唔到。 3. 想攞番登入名，攪一大輪，話攞番，衰多手比零分抨分，又一定要寫評論，唔寫close左佢結果乜都冇。。要打電話？ 4. 想攞番密碼，攪完一大輪，話冇mobile key。點解一早又唔講？ 5. 浪費大量時間，結果又係要去銀行。 垃圾之中嘅垃圾。\",[1765188831,748000000],0,null,null,[\"100317337891349340204\",\"Y. H. Au\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK5GsKQ8oel6-BmLb9_HiXjsSvVDL0jIpQo0OU6XZhPr81QGg\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"7.3.8\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"ede15fea-0ad2-48a8-b604-7e7121e49120\",[\"Bo Wong\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUayM0L-jUJ2xp2V9p1amHncIP8VIzwhOMqTjUqsShiDSUYqAkM\"]]],1,null,\"one the worst banking apps, for the simple reason that it doesn't load; or when it does, becomes unresponsive all of a sudden. IT IS UNUSUABLE. And the interface? it's not user-friendly nor intuitive. Whoever designed it deserves to be fired.\",[1765095613,152000000],5,null,null,[\"106523248800223435298\",\"Bo Wong\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUayM0L-jUJ2xp2V9p1amHnc